@startuml 10_profile
!include _style.iuml
title Profile Diagram — «MultiAgentPlatform» UML profile used in these diagrams\n(drawn as a class diagram: PlantUML has no native profile type)

package "«profile» MultiAgentPlatform" as Prof {
  class "Class" as MClass <<metaclass>>
  class "Component" as MComp <<metaclass>>
  class "Operation" as MOp <<metaclass>>

  class TenantScoped <<stereotype>> {
    business_id : UUID
    rls : Boolean = true
  }
  class Versioned <<stereotype>> {
    version : Integer {>= 1}
  }
  class AppendOnly <<stereotype>>
  class Agent <<stereotype>> {
    role : AgentRole
    allowedTools : String[*]
  }
  class Tool <<stereotype>> {
    name : String
    isWrite : Boolean
    requiresConfirmation : Boolean
  }
  class Untrusted <<stereotype>>
  class Planned <<stereotype>> {
    milestone : String
  }
  class Port <<stereotype>>
}

TenantScoped -up-> MClass : <<extension>>
Versioned -up-> MClass : <<extension>>
AppendOnly -up-> MClass : <<extension>>
Agent -up-> MComp : <<extension>>
Tool -up-> MOp : <<extension>>
Untrusted -up-> MClass : <<extension>>
Planned -up-> MComp : <<extension>>
Port -up-> MClass : <<extension>>

note bottom of Prof
  TenantScoped: every table except businesses and app_users
  (composite FK + forced RLS). Versioned: optimistic locking
  for mutable rows. AppendOnly: audit_logs, agent_steps, embeddings.
  Untrusted: AgentDecision and document text.
  Planned: orchestrator (M09–M11), channel adapters, forecast model.
  Port: typing.Protocol interfaces (BrainPort, ExecutorPort, LLMProvider…).
end note
@enduml
